⚡🇮🇹 50 vials of fentanyl were stolen from the pharmacy of the Nuova Itor clinic in the Pietralata district of Rome.

The theft reportedly occurred between October 16 and 18. This is the second incident of its kind in the capital, following the theft of 80 vials from the Israelitico hospital in July. Investigative hypotheses include resale on the black market and the supply of clandestine clinics.

